      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NITRO MOON (2) missed the frame last time at this track but just three runs back rocketed around 515m at this track in 29.44. Smart win three back and looks a key chance here. CRYSTAL (3) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (29.54) from Box 2 at this track. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Overdue and is among the main hopes. GOOD LUCK BABE (1) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at her last seven runs. Last time finished 3rd over 515m at this track beaten 6 lengths (29.83) behind Buckle Up Menzie in a Grade 3 on October 26. Has performed well from this box with a win and four minor placings to her name from seven starts. Expected to feature again. AARIELLA'S GIRL (6) was well fancied last time on the strength of a win two back but could only manage fifth (19.64) at Hobart.",
